{"id":10000074,"name":"莱依拉","enName":"Layla","title":"绮思晚星","element":"冰","region":"须弥","rarity":4,"weapon":"单手剑","birthday":"12月19日","constellation":"夜莺座","description":"专攻理论星相学的梨多梵谛学院学生。时常梦游，长期缺觉，饱受睡眠问题困扰。","affiliation":"梨多梵谛学院","cv":{"chinese":"侯小菲","japanese":"富田美忧","english":"阿希礼·比斯琪","korean":"姜新春"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000074-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000074-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Layla.zip","voicePackageEn":"Layla","quoteCount":66,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"哈…你好，我是梨多梵谛学院的在读学生莱依拉。…嗯？对不起，昨天没睡好我现在精神有点差，你刚才是在说「想和我组队」吗？\n没有没有，我不是不愿意，只是怕你不习惯我的作息方式…那、那个…请多关照！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/pwq5qk2dvv5rntv3wl4xlqwwah8yjsd.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·注视","desc":"就算我们不抬头仰望，星空，也永远注视着我们。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/i8g8682a2svn7qw8dheypo2lltk09te.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·梦游","desc":"腿好酸…唉，大概昨天晚上又梦游了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/9hf8ips6z9jmh535w229r0fbiw5y7sx.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·哀叹","desc":"…为什么报告和论文永远写不完？为什么？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/bsqq66vgtlymgfobujj819emag5f9yp.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"天气好差，今晚没法观测星空的话…唉，我的星图课作业真的不能再拖了啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/ad4fzzsbyrqsok02rzx6bfieleofnw5.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"雪地看起来亮晶晶的，很像天上的星星。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/eq0o4bege15mv56czw8dnsogz4snhjw.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"太阳晒着…好困…对，保持这个感觉，赶快找个枕头睡一觉…我已经两天、两天没有…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/em29q229kcfvhlgowwn9g1iwl6dl1hd.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"白天晒，晚上冷，我、我要不行了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/i95n5jp1hy6457d6u9uvmsla5f3dvro.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"你睡得饱吗？要是还困就回去再睡会儿吧…我？我…习惯了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/hdmoi6skon0vl28nl64ic9nsnna1alj.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"我在计算星轨呢，刚算到一半，午饭你就先吃好了…这里的角度不太对劲吧…不、不会吧…我是从哪儿开始算错了呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/68bwly0ruobn70cyjnkpd8h9bl1hybk.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"今晚我要早早躺到床上去，争取早点睡着。伟大的智慧之神啊，求您庇护我的睡眠。好，我要闭上眼睛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/6baxdf3ypmmqyilumef9q06vo8dqg4n.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"…哈，让我看看她又被什么难住了。嗯…要整理三年份的旧星表，中期报告的附录还缺几张星图没画…好吧，从这份开始。\n嗯，你怎么来了？现在可是最重要的睡眠时间。我？我当然是在梦游了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/mc4yd8cacy1xezcaudaidgqw9fduvmv.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱依拉自己·理论星相学","desc":"按照教科书上的说法：「利用理论星相学知识解决具体生活中的麻烦，这不是我们该关心的问题。」其实我觉得还有一个重要原因…就是…嗯，成本太高。我们测算的时候，一般会动用好多台星象仪，至少要查阅一年份的星图，才好给出一套…严谨的答案。但如果是为了算明天香料会不会涨价，怎么想都不太划算吧…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/nvg05pas1v3scot8sk33p0mc3f54aze.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱依拉自己·理由","desc":"既然有了自己喜欢又能做得好的事，就得坚持下去，哪怕这条道路特别艰辛，哪怕一路上竞争极其激烈，哪怕不一定能顺利毕业，哪怕没能顺利毕业的话，就要把所有的奖学金还回去…啊，要不我还是回家吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/g91oy7gujm1rub8bm1cqvrbprgqlsuy.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·陪伴","desc":"嗯哼，我也不想熬夜补课题进度，可谁叫她总有那么多做不完的事。没办法，我当然得帮帮她咯。…你想陪我一起吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/r8x3t6kd4f50wq9lb5hz957o2sxgd9t.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·漫游世界","desc":"如果毕业之后，我没有留在教令院工作，就和你一起去漫游世界吧。你觉得怎么样？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/hpypsfy6kya77i9yrrybnf7khf5htpf.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"哈…是什么在亮？我睡觉的时候忘了关灯吗…哦，是神之眼啊，我说呢…欸，不对，我睡觉之前…把它放在床头了吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/2spag12gvwcigr0qh6kzoq0ax84oq5h.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"我们学院主编的星表汇聚了所有生灵的命运，毫无疑问是占星知识的顶峰，第一次看到的时候我整个人都被吓得说不出话了！欸？你感兴趣吗？只是简单看看的话…我帮你提交申请吧，应该能被批准，应该…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/stgrnziigv0d2ps7h7yrwik8ungsnr4.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"有没有什么能捕虫的植物啊，快救救我吧。晚上本来就睡不着，房间里还有小飞虫，一直嗡嗡响个不停，但我、我怎么找都找不到它在哪里…呜呜…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/bukzvpprwd0qshg8eiww2bzoelkbnju.mp3"},{"title":"关于莫娜…","desc":"在明论派学者的小圈子里，阿斯托洛吉斯·莫娜·梅姬斯图斯发表在《蒸汽鸟报》上的星相学文章名气不小。那些文章专业性都很强，但却能被学者之外的群体喜欢，要做到这点还是挺不容易的…欸？我把她的名字念得很流利？因为…厉害的人…得多多尊敬。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_mona_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/89/i10hq6wakd0xhl6htljejn2cjuthfh4.mp3"},{"title":"关于丽莎…","desc":"啊，我知道你在说谁了。丽莎·敏兹，传说中只用了两年就学成毕业的素论派天才，要是我也能有这样的头脑…你在蒙德的时候见过她本人？真、真的吗？她平时都是怎么学习的？看些什么书，做些什么工作？我…我该从哪里向她学起？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_lisa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/pk4kkn687xavaprt0k7ttoepjptbgi1.mp3"},{"title":"关于多莉…","desc":"多、莉、吗…我咬着牙、攥着拳头在她那里买过一次东西，她看我结账很痛快，好像误以为我是什么有钱人，后来还一直寄商品宣传单给我，唔…真是天大的误会！那次购物的代价…不仅把我的奖学金垫进去了，接下来的大半年里，我吃饭都不敢多要肉，买书还得等打折…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_dori_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/bk5ahom1wtj7sw9r6140nyl8a496sf3.mp3"},{"title":"关于赛诺…","desc":"「大风纪官」大人很擅长「七圣召唤」吗…啊我是在想，有机会的话，说不定可以和他打一局。像「七圣召唤」这种牌类游戏，熟练掌握运算技巧的人玩起来总是简单一点，我反而…不一定…或许不会输给他。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_cyno_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/auijahv72j0kgkcxoe0950uaen3it99.mp3"},{"title":"关于坎蒂丝…","desc":"我第一次梦游醒来的时候，曾经见到过你描述的这个人，原来她叫坎蒂丝啊。我还记得自己醒来的那一刻…所有报告和文章都被完成了。当时的感觉就好像…好像我每天对着星空念叨，终于被星星听见了，它们派了一位使者来帮助我，呜呜…太感动了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_candace_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/dx7sa4cbr0b7s8gqjjqg6q89kicmkrb.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾尔海森…","desc":"职务达到书记官这种高度的人，应该就不用发愁能不能立项、能不能成功了吧。不对，既然都当了书记官，应该连项目都不用做了。真好啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_alhaitham_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/33/sa5j3hwyqk6oxlaov4yoi9dgg2wv74s.mp3"},{"title":"关于小吉祥草王…","desc":"伟大的智慧之神，我最近每晚都在熬夜复习，考试就请让我通过吧！拜托了拜托了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_nahida_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/hgcoij57kqboqn9vt2hmts3hlurw05f.mp3"},{"title":"关于珐露珊…","desc":"珐露珊老师招到学生了吗？听知论派的人说，她的项目申请经费一直很难，招不到学生也很正常。唉…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_teammate_faruzan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a9/gzb8nanpdx3udmfl86zisbflbwr7qu9.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱依拉·其一","desc":"我算不上有天赋，领悟力也不太够…拼命读书通过考试这才进了教令院。对不起，我…我先不跟你闲聊了，一说到教令院我就想起来，我的课题进度报告…到现在为止还没有进度呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/3sx1bunf010icwq69q3kufdnvvieuyu.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱依拉·其二","desc":"我和导师的关系吗？嗯…怎么说呢…啊，你不要误会了，其实导师对我挺好的，我入学的时候还得到了她的推荐呢。每次我觉得自己要撑不住了，她都会鼓励我，然后顺便多要求一篇论文…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3b/8m0gzhy7yw0sj7dfxq4qj29zx43c4s7.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱依拉·其三","desc":"整个须弥最有才能的人几乎都到教令院来了，而且这儿还有那么多聪明得让人发抖的外国学者，你想想，这里的竞争该有多大！和这些人一起学习…我真的够格吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ab/oygs7jb5rvmuekfpvtx3q4if81th2p8.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱依拉·其四","desc":"嘘，小声点，不要吵醒她，就让她安心睡上一觉吧。你问我嘴里的「她」是谁？哦，当然是每天为课业抓耳挠腮的莱依拉呀。那我是谁？呵呵，我也是莱依拉呀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/kp7y2uali3i99wmxpdeukm7a6opmrdy.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱依拉·其五","desc":"我听别人提过，她好像以为所有写不完的课业总能在一场梦之后自动完成，都是「星空的赐福」。她呀，完全搞错了哦。…不过，你可别告诉她哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/4rnqun1btia9qvhp3g0x3epu7sws8kh.mp3"},{"title":"莱依拉的爱好…","desc":"画星图真的是件累人的事，如果不是因为喜欢，我恐怕也坚持不下来。一会儿要用尺、一会儿要拿纸算、一会儿要查历年的星象…不知不觉一天时间就过去了。但看着画得整整齐齐的巨大星图，总是很有成就感。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/t3kcvux7mokryhqdm6ei0uzebif89n0.mp3"},{"title":"莱依拉的烦恼…","desc":"从前我还没进入教令院念书的时候，睡眠质量还算过得去。但自从在这里学习之后…唔，压力实在是太恐怖了…我真的很想每天安安稳稳一觉到天亮，呜呜…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/8cdqbcs6xk6c38aqvdd8rar9kwt96el.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"每晚我躺上床之前，都会为自己热一杯牛奶喝，希望夜里能有个好觉，希望夜里能有个好觉，希望夜里能有个好觉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_pref_foodLike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3a/f90kqrlfu4vdtag7cg5tn32y3vbf0l3.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"有一次，我听人说，有个神奇商人在卖的「睡眠软糖」很有效。我花光了奖学金和攒下的零花钱试了试，确实有效，那阵子我也睡得很好。但一盒卖二十万摩拉…实在太贵了，我、我绝对不会再买了，买一送一也不行，买一送二的话…我就再考虑考虑。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/3gdtkgoojirjlg7aivc718a0yunhkso.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"好厉害，好羡慕，你还真是什么都会呀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/7p3w2hf22g0glvvs7dk8quplfini8ab.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"…嗯，味道还算不错。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/pnd3ohziwtbcsoyc7q2im72ihd4yrnt.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"要不…我们还是去店里买外带吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/75/mwxr0dm1ivay70khvvo1tc5i7r3m5tn.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐，我把这个袖珍星盘送给你。希望从过去到未来，见证了我们所有人类命运的星星能把目光分给你，伴随你走过沙漠、穿过海洋，到达你所探寻的终点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c6/heanlh39zxor92dj4l7pfgh8ezz95wt.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"莱依拉啊莱依拉，你还要更勤奋。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/aptntq4qpum9r8gms0oy8h2cjxyhwo6.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"莱依拉啊莱依拉，你已经很勤奋了，不过你的知识还不够全面。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/79/27xmolyomm9k3ysl3of2tz5zy1jo9ci.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"莱依拉啊莱依拉，你读书又勤奋又广博，这很好。但你可千万不能松懈，一时懈怠，就会落后于人，最后悲惨延毕。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/65/f9k02ulwkyfdxbgpqhtxj0vwdto9ccf.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"莱依拉啊莱依拉，要相信自己，也要相信帮了你那么多的那个人。你们一起，什么问题都能解决！\n呼…好了，所有担心我都抛到脑后了，咱们出发吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_layla/vo_layla_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2c/3gd71cq6gwug02drz6m560s5qqul9kz.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"寒星！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/gbmls7ygyd51cqubq6x0vqh0cnbliiw.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"拒绝打扰！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/9ui0ch1natlx8eygo9vrf8mnjmj1znl.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"星星的加护。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/73/ix96bk8xwqf28fkqf5imxip59vsi735.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"星辰，为我降下。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/gdjvwnph3i437tvujjipraqbpj5264q.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"极寒，任我驱使。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/dou7bqbk23cqyiptp8oyxyv83rli55t.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"别害怕。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/6gy1d9wl82puc0xpoirhdivbkx5z0rf.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"性价比不错。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/e4js1i6f9ezjy2fva0zppsnclh5rcr3.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"还是你眼睛尖。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/bx0v06tuvnhg4v0dc0jjuluso9ztjn8.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"哇！突然感觉不困了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/81/9wohlza30ijlnjv45tnm43hrbj4wc1k.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"我好困…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/759i0k7xcukxutya8jjhr5z6979qp2v.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"完了完了完了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/r0vwuc9t1yzdqemlp3gnw81rvn0fc0s.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"现在逃还来得及吗？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/swa6uolrlbx0jrq1mcxw7njfln1wmlc.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"醒醒，别昏过去！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b9/suntj9kqcp66fcd6plsarr8ri1t3ire.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"糟了糟了，你、你受伤了！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/89/fc045upbvrl5y8xbkgd95bsmguxxv14.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"永恒的睡眠…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/gqds0pd58726f8r2c8p0oqm9weltv4x.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"老师，对不起…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/i7ikzcf0h3p0u9f8o3qfc33y1iqtje2.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"拜托了，这是个…梦…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/00xyip5dzqo9tvsjbthjpby5ge8mly2.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"你不讲理！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/nrp73g2bvqa22e5admxaqwt9fyxx4kt.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"这是违反规定的！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_layla/vo_layla_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/hgzl9gp9xsqi2ck0gidhljtw07fhdc8.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"睡不着就四处走走吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_layla_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/6lj9g37zv43bo25ghznt57w6lswbh54.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"请好假了…没有忘的吧？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_layla_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/r759fcii3kqmf3xwjnwgl6qupit2ztl.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"唉，脑袋空空，出去放松。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_layla_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/duomcbpfxde65lndu01ww0hjqz612zd.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000074-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000074-full.webp","fullArtWidth":879,"fullArtHeight":859}